      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2100,
      "width": 225.68000000000004,
      "height": 113.75,
      "text": "No hand-labelling.\nNo annotator disagreement.\nNo circular grading.\n\nA file downsampled to 72 DPI is\nlabelled LOW_RESOLUTION because\nthe generator MADE it that way.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "No hand-labelling.\nNo annotator disagreement.\nNo circular grading.\n\nA file downsampled to 72 DPI is\nlabelled LOW_RESOLUTION because\nthe generator MADE it that way.",
